Single #pragma omp parallel region spans all reps, avoiding per-iteration fork/join overhead across the 20 reps.

Each rep is an omp for (implicit barrier ensures all writes to y from rep r are visible before rep r+1 reads them — required for correctness since each rep depends on the previous one through y).

